#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:54
msgid ""
"This access control system allows to define granular roles and permissions "
"for different functionalities of the platform"
msgstr ""
"Ce système de contrôle d’accès permet de définir des rôles et des "
"autorisations granulaires pour différentes fonctionnalités de la plateforme"

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:63
msgid "Who can manage questions?"
msgstr "Qui peut gérer les questions ?"

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:70
msgid "Grant premium features to administrators?"
msgstr "Accorder les fonctionnalités Premium aux administrateurs ?"

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:107
msgid ""
"This feature allows specific roles with at least the capability to publish "
"posts to access the question management (viewing, editing, and deleting "
"questions). However, access to plugin settings is restricted to "
"administrators only."
msgstr ""
"Cette fonctionnalité permet à des rôles spécifiques ayant au moins la "
"capacité de publier des messages d’accéder à la gestion des questions "
"(affichage, modification et suppression des questions). Cependant, l’accès "
"aux paramètres du plugin est limité aux administrateurs uniquement."

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:124
msgid ""
"Please note: The Administrator role cannot be disabled and always has access "
"to plugin settings."
msgstr ""
"Attention : le rôle d’administrateur ne peut pas être désactivé et a "
"toujours accès aux paramètres du plugin."

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:140
msgid "Check to grant premium features to administrators"
msgstr ""
"Cochez cette case pour accorder les fonctionnalités Premium aux "
"administrateurs"

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:98
msgid ""
"Create and manage membership plans with one-time or recurring payments, "
"secure payment processing, and controlled access to premium quiz content."
msgstr ""
"Créez et gérez des formules d'abonnement avec des paiements ponctuels ou "
"récurrents, un traitement sécurisé des paiements et un accès contrôlé à du "
"contenu premium sous forme de quiz."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:100
msgid ""
"Flexible subscription plans with configurable names, descriptions, prices, "
"durations, and recurring or one-time billing."
msgstr ""
"Formules d'abonnement flexibles permettant de personnaliser les noms, les "
"descriptions, les prix, les durées, ainsi que la facturation récurrente ou "
"ponctuelle."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:101
msgid ""
"Stripe and PayPal payment integrations with secure webhook handling and "
"server-side payment verification."
msgstr ""
"Intégrations de paiement Stripe et PayPal avec gestion sécurisée des "
"webhooks et vérification des paiements côté serveur."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:102
msgid ""
"Automatic subscription management, including payment confirmation, "
"cancellation, refunds, and payment status tracking."
msgstr ""
"Gestion automatique des abonnements, notamment la confirmation des "
"paiements, les résiliations, les remboursements et le suivi de l'état des "
"paiements."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:103
msgid ""
"Stripe 3D Secure support, with membership access granted only after payment "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Prise en charge de Stripe 3D Secure, l'accès à l'abonnement n'étant accordé "
"qu'après confirmation du paiement."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:104
msgid "Premium content access control based on subscription status and plan."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:105
msgid ""
"User registration, login, profile management, and subscription dashboard "
"with billing information and history."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:106
msgid ""
"Customizable email notification templates for subscription-related events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:107
msgid ""
"Shortcodes and Gutenberg blocks for displaying subscription plans, login and "
"registration forms, account dashboards, and payment success pages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:108
msgid ""
"Admin management of plans and subscriptions, with CSV export capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:109
msgid ""
"REST API endpoints and developer hooks for integrating and extending "
"subscription functionality."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:124
msgid ""
"Run an affiliate program for your quizzes: track referrals, attribute "
"subscription conversions, calculate commissions, and manage affiliate "
"payouts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:126
msgid ""
"Affiliate referral links with unique tokens, click tracking, last-click "
"attribution, and a configurable attribution window."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:127
msgid ""
"Automatic conversion tracking and percentage-based commission calculation, "
"with support for subscription lifecycle events, refunds, and commission "
"tiers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:128
msgid ""
"Affiliate dashboard and signup form, available through Gutenberg blocks and "
"shortcodes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:129
msgid ""
"Payout management: generate and schedule payouts, approve eligible "
"conversions, mark payouts as paid, and export filtered payout data to CSV."
msgstr ""
"Gestion des paiements : générez et planifiez des paiements, approuvez les "
"conversions éligibles, marquez les paiements comme effectués et exportez des "
"données de paiement filtrées au format CSV."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:130
msgid ""
"Optional PayPal automatic payouts with scheduled processing, configurable "
"payout limits, and batch history."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:131
msgid ""
"Admin reports and analytics: Overview, Top Affiliates, and Click Anomalies, "
"with filters and CSV export."
msgstr ""
"Rapports et analyses pour les administrateurs : vue d’ensemble, meilleurs "
"affiliés et anomalies de clics, avec filtres et exportation au format CSV."

