msgstr ""
"Attribuez des scores aux prospects en fonction de leur activité dans les "
"quiz et de leurs événements d’engagement, créez des segments dynamiques et "
"synchronisez vos contacts avec HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive ou des points "
"de terminaison webhook personnalisés."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:322
msgid ""
"Configurable scoring rules based on quiz answers and events, with automatic "
"score updates and detailed scoring history."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:323
msgid ""
"Configurable score decay for inactive leads, with automatic periodic "
"recalculation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:324
msgid ""
"Dynamic segments defined through JSON rules, with conditions based on lead "
"scores, tags, dates, and events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:325
msgid ""
"CRM integrations with HubSpot, Salesforce (OAuth 2.0), and Pipedrive, plus "
"support for custom webhook endpoints."
msgstr ""
"Intégrations CRM avec HubSpot, Salesforce (OAuth 2.0) et Pipedrive, ainsi "
"que la prise en charge de points de terminaison webhook personnalisés."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:326
msgid ""
"Configurable field mapping for CRM synchronization, including lead scores "
"and segment membership."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:327
msgid ""
"Manual, event-based, and scheduled synchronization with queued processing, "
"automatic retries, and backoff."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:328
msgid ""
"Admin dashboard with lead scoring metrics, segment insights, and "
"synchronization status."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:329
msgid ""
"Synchronization and event logs with filtering, CSV/JSON export, and "
"configurable data retention."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:330
msgid ""
"Developer hooks and filters to customize score adjustments, segment "
"handling, and administrative capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:344
msgid ""
"Add multilingual capabilities focused on Form Quizz FQI3: define default/"
"available/fallback languages (auto-detected from site locale), display a "
"language switcher, and enable SEO best practices (URL mode + hreflang) "
"without the complexity of a full site-wide framework."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez des capacités multilingues centrées sur Form Quizz FQI3 : définissez "
"les langues par défaut/disponibles/de secours (détectées automatiquement "
"depuis la langue du site), affichez un sélecteur de langue et activez les "
"bonnes pratiques SEO (mode d’URL + hreflang) sans la complexité d’un "
"framework global."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:346
msgid ""
"Language settings: default, available and fallback languages (defaults from "
"site locale)."
msgstr ""
"Paramètres de langue : langues par défaut, disponibles et de secours "
"(valeurs par défaut depuis la langue du site)."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:347
msgid ""
"Language switcher: header/menu/footer or manual via shortcode/PHP, with "
"optional flags."
msgstr ""
"Sélecteur de langue : en-tête/menu/pied de page ou manuel via shortcode/PHP, "
"avec drapeaux en option."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:348
msgid ""
"SEO helpers: language in URL (subdirectory or query param) and hreflang tags."
msgstr ""
"Aides SEO : langue dans l’URL (sous-répertoire ou paramètre de requête) et "
"balises hreflang."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:349
msgid ""
"Integrations: auto-create translation placeholders, optional ACF fields sync."
msgstr ""
"Intégrations : création automatique d’espaces réservés de traduction, "
"synchronisation facultative des champs ACF."

#: includes/admin/class-add-ons.php:350
msgid ""
"Developer hooks: filter languages, positions, and URL modes to extend "
