"This page displays all the attempts made by users on the quizzes. You can "
"filter the attempts by level, user ID, from date, and to date. You can also "
"export the attempts to a CSV file. You can also purge the attempts. The "
"purge is automatic after <strong>%1$d</strong> days (<a href=\"%2$s\">View "
"settings</a>)."
