msgid "User Meta Keys"
msgstr "Clés méta utilisateur"

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:400
msgid ""
"Quiz data is primarily stored in custom tables (performance, periodic "
"statistics, attempts). The parent plugin writes these user meta keys:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:401
msgid "quizzes started today (daily limit)."
msgstr "les quiz ont commencé aujourd’hui (limite quotidienne)."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:402
msgid ""
"attempt in progress: attempt id, level and the questions served for it. "
"Removed when the attempt is completed."
msgstr ""
"tentative en cours : identifiant de la tentative, niveau et questions "
"proposées dans ce cadre. Supprimé une fois la tentative terminée."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:403
msgid ""
"server-side result of the last completed attempt, consumed once by "
"fqi3_before_results_quiz_form."
msgstr ""
"résultat côté serveur de la dernière tentative terminée, consommé une fois "
"par fqi3_before_results_quiz_form."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:406
msgid "Hooks"
msgstr "Crochets"

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:407
msgid ""
"Core exposes runtime hooks and configuration filters for addons. Below is "
"the consolidated list."
msgstr ""
"Le noyau expose les hooks d'exécution et les filtres de configuration des "
"modules complémentaires. Vous trouverez ci-dessous la liste complète."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:410
msgid ""
"(filter) Allow addons to provide a deterministic question set for a level."
msgstr ""
"(filtre) Permet aux modules complémentaires de fournir un ensemble de "
"questions déterministes pour un niveau."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:414
msgid ""
"(filter) Allow addons to register their own shortcode-based Gutenberg blocks."
msgstr ""
"(filtre) Autoriser les modules complémentaires à enregistrer leurs propres "
"blocs Gutenberg basés sur des codes courts."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:418
msgid ""
"(action) Fired when the final set is fixed; consume context for logging."
msgstr ""
"(action) Déclenché lorsque l'ensemble final est corrigé ; consomme le "
"contexte pour la journalisation."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:422
msgid ""
"(filter) The questions about to be sent to the browser, after the questions "
"cache. Use it to localize or adjust the content. Never change the ids, their "
"order, the number of options or the \"answer\" index: scoring is done server-"
"side from the ids and the option indexes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:426
msgid ""
"(action) A question was added, updated or deleted from the admin screens."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:430
msgid ""
"(action) Import of questions: all questions were deleted first (replace "
"mode; question ids change), then fired once after the questions were "
"inserted (not once per question). Questions inserted by the import do not "
"fire fqi3_question_created."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:434
msgid ""
"(filter) The question rows returned by the REST endpoints /quizzes, /quizzes/"
"{id} and /quizzes/level/{name}, after the API cache. Do not change the ids, "
"the number of options or the \"answer\" index."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:438
msgid ""
"(filter) Suffix added to the REST API cache keys. Return a stable value (for "
"example a language slug) when an add-on changes the content of a response "
"per request, so one variant is never served from another variant's cache "
"entry."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:442
msgid ""
"(action) The core is loaded. Boot add-ons from here (or from plugins_loaded "
"at priority 10+): WordPress loads \"form-quizz-fqi3-xxx/\" plugins before "
"\"form-quizz-fqi3/\", so the core constants and classes do not exist while "
"an add-on main file is being included."
msgstr ""
"(action) Le noyau est chargé. Chargez les extensions à partir d’ici (ou via "
"le hook `plugins_loaded` avec une priorité de 10 ou plus) : WordPress charge "
"les extensions du type « form-quizz-fqi3-xxx/ » avant « form-quizz-fqi3/ » ; "
"par conséquent, les constantes et les classes du noyau ne sont pas encore "
"définies au moment où le fichier principal d’une extension est inclus."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:446
msgid ""
"(action) A server-side attempt was created. Fired once per attempt, for "
"logged-in users only. attempt_id is always greater than 0."
msgstr ""
"(action) Une tentative côté serveur a été créée. Déclenché une fois par "
"tentative, uniquement pour les utilisateurs connectés. L’identifiant "
"`attempt_id` est toujours supérieur à 0."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:450
msgid ""
"(action) An attempt was completed. Fired exactly once per attempt, for "
"logged-in users only, after the server checked that its questions were "
"served, and with a score computed by the server from the submitted answers "
"(the score sent by the browser is ignored). attempt_id is always greater "
"than 0."
msgstr ""
"(action) Une tentative a été effectuée. Cet événement est déclenché "
"exactement une fois par tentative, uniquement pour les utilisateurs "
"connectés, une fois que le serveur a vérifié que les questions ont bien été "
"transmises ; il inclut un score calculé par le serveur à partir des réponses "
"soumises (le score envoyé par le navigateur est ignoré). L'identifiant "
"`attempt_id` est toujours supérieur à 0."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:454
msgid ""
"(action) Before the results are displayed. Only trust it when $verified is "
"true (logged-in user: level and score recorded by the server). It is also "
"fired at page render with placeholder values and $verified = false, and for "
"visitors with browser-supplied values: never use an unverified call to grant "
"points, badges or data."
msgstr ""
"(action) Avant l'affichage des résultats. Ne vous y fiez que lorsque "
"`$verified` est vrai (utilisateur connecté : niveau et score enregistrés par "
"le serveur). Cet événement est également déclenché lors du rendu de la page "
"avec des valeurs par défaut (placeholders) et `$verified = false`, ainsi que "
"pour les visiteurs dont les valeurs sont fournies par le navigateur : "
"n'utilisez jamais un appel non vérifié pour attribuer des points, des badges "
"ou des données."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:458
msgid ""
"(filter) Whether the current user may request the questions of a level. Runs "
"on every request: keep callbacks cheap (cached lookups, no remote call). The "
"core rules (levels flagged free for visitors) give the initial value; the "
"filter has the final say, so it can restrict a level or open it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:462
msgid ""
"(filter) Exempts a user from the daily quiz limit of free members for the "
"requested level. Only evaluated once the limit is reached."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:466
msgid ""
"(filter) Lock state of a level in the level picker: a padlock, a message and "
"an optional link instead of a selectable option. Display only, the server-"
"side access check is fqi3_user_can_access_level."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:470
msgid ""
"(action) Fired when the results container is rendered, before any quiz is "
"played, with placeholder values: never use its arguments as a result. Use "
"fqi3_quiz_attempt_completed for verified data."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:474
msgid ""
"(filter) Minimum seconds per question between the questions being served and "
"the completion of the quiz (default 1, 0 disables the check)."
msgstr ""
"(filtre) Nombre minimal de secondes par question, entre le moment où les "
"questions sont présentées et celui où le quiz est terminé (valeur par "
"défaut : 1 ; 0 désactive cette vérification)."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:478
msgid "(action) Inject a top panel into the core questions screen."
msgstr ""
"(action) Injecter un panneau supérieur dans l'écran des questions "
"principales."

#: includes/admin/class-developper.php:482
msgid ""
"(filter) Append custom actions HTML to each question row (View Questions "
